    "updated_at": "2021-04-30T09:34:51Z",
    "body": "I think this would be great. Another one would be for illustrating how the various fetch algorithms end up invoking each other. My main problem with diagrams has always been finding the right tool that spits out workable non-bloated SVG that can be made accessible somehow and more importantly, allows for ongoing maintenance. (And perhaps I have that problem because I never put a lot of time into it, but if someone has suggestions...)",
