    "updated_at": "2021-04-30T10:06:32Z",
    "body": "when @sideshowbarker and I discussed this, I thought the conversion into diagram might indeed be an obstacle to maintenance - I know there are a number of tools that takes a text format and turn them into SVG charts, although I haven't reviewed yet how well they would work for this.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that we should start documenting the flow in any kind of structured text form (which helps with maintenance and is already useful in itself), and restructure it into whatever input format the final tool we would find would work with.",
